    "footer": {
      "tagline": "Orbit Ceramic is a handcrafted ceramic and pottery studio based in Lahore, Pakistan, specializing in handmade ceramic art, antique pottery, clay craftsmanship, and timeless home décor. Every piece is carefully shaped by hand using premium clay, blending traditional pottery techniques with contemporary design to create functional works of art that last for generations.",
